message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GLASTOR® spec-stream: High-Performance, Model-Agnostic Speculative Decoding and Paged KV-Cache Engine for Large Language Models in Pure Rust"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
authors:
